              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Jane Braun"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Made this as a main dish for my husband and self: added some leftover black beans, increased the amount of tomatoes, cucumber, and feta cheese. Did not increase olive oil, but added a tablespoon of white wine vinegar and several good shakes of Greek seasoning blend. My husband claimed the leftovers for his next meal.",
