              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "DBliek"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Made this tonight, it was absolutely delicious! I will definitely make again! I doubled the recipe but followed it almost to a T... Couldn't find plain couscous so I used the Olive Oil and Roasted Garlic by Near East and I did add the seasoning pack for more flavor, to keep with that theme, I added some roasted minced garlic too. I actually forgot the olive oil and it tasted great anyway! Saved some calories but kept all the amazing flavor, great recipe, thank you!",
